              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.26.3+LEV.26.4+LEV.26.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 26:3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.12+DEU.7.13+DEU.7.14+DEU.7.15+DEU.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amaf 7:12-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.1+DEU.28.2+DEU.28.3+DEU.28.4+DEU.28.5+DEU.28.6+DEU.28.7+DEU.28.8+DEU.28.9+DEU.28.10+DEU.28.11+DEU.28.12+DEU.28.13+DEU.28.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28:1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kanshi imwe nga mukalakonka amafunde bwino bwino ayo namupeela ilelo, ayakutemwa Yawe Lesa wenu no kulamubombela ne mitima yenu yonse ne myeo yenu yonse, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lyena ninshi nkalamutumina imfula mu calo cenu ilyo ilekabilwa, pa mibundo na mu mainsa, pakuti mukalesombola iŋanu, umwangashi upya, na mafuta ya miolifa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkamesha ifyani mu mabala ifyakuti iŋombe shenu shikalelya, kabili na imwe mukalalya no kwikuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muleba abacenjela epali mwasangukila Yawe no kulapepa imilungu imbi no kulaifukamina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga mukalacita ifyo, lyena ubukali bwakwa Yawe bukamwishila. Akesala ne myulu pakuti akaleshe imfula ukulaloka, no mushili ukakaane no kumesha ifisabo. Ninshi nemwe bene tamwakakokole ukuloba muli cilya calo cisuma Yawe akamupeela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
